duties:
bTaskee is looking for an extremely impressive person to fill the role of Middle React Native Developer, building high-performance mobile applications, optimizing micro-frontend integration, and collaborating with teams to enhance user experiences.

Responsibilities And Duties
- Develop and maintain cross-platform mobile applications (iOS & Android) using React Native
- Collaborate with Backend, UI/UX teams to design, optimize, and enhance app performance.
- Ensure the quality, scalability, and security of mobile applications.
- Troubleshoot issues and improve app functionality based on user feedback and team requirements.
- Stay up-to-date with new technologies and industry trends.
- Familiarity with version control (Git) and mobile debugging tools.
- Attention to detail and a passion for creating great user experiences. Comfortable using AI coding assistants

Qualifications And Skills
Must to Have
- Bachelor’s Degree in Software Engineer/Information Technology or IT-related major;
- Have 2+ years of experience in mobile application development, specifically with React Native;
- Proven experience building and deploying complex applications using Re.Pack, Module Federation, or similar tools;
- Deep understanding of JavaScript, TypeScript, and modern frontend development.
- Proficiency with state management solutions (Redux, MobX) and native development tools (Xcode, Android Studio);
- Strong experience in performance optimization, debugging, and deploying to app stores;
- Have a personal laptop.

Nice to have
- Experience with micro-frontend architectures in production environments;
- Knowledge of containerization and orchestration (Docker, Kubernetes).

Why You'll Love Working Here
- Professional Development: Upgrade your skills and ignite your career;
- Collaborative Atmosphere: Everyone works together to execute the mission;
- Team Spirit: Caring for our people and bonding together are musts for us;
- Dynamic Growth: Our teams are scaling up quickly. There’s no better time than now to come on board;

At bTaskee, we don’t just work – we thrive with top-notch benefits!
- Competitive Salary – Rewarded based on your experience and skills;
- Annual Performance Review – Unlock growth opportunities every year;
- KPI-Based Salary – Earn what you deserve through your contributions;
- 13th-Month Bonus – Rewarded based on both your performance and the company’s success;
- BYOD Support – Get an allowance while enjoying the flexibility of using your own laptop;
- Comprehensive Healthcare – Regular check-ups & a premium health package;
- SHUI Compliance – Contributions aligned with legal regulations;
- Generous Leave Policy – Enjoy 12–16 annual leave days per year;
- Celebration Perks – Special benefits for birthdays, weddings, childbirth, and more;
- Engaging Workplace – Activities & exciting team-building events;
- Advance Home Care Benefit – Get a monthly bTaskee package, freeing up your time for learning, relaxation, and self-care.

🚀 Join us and thrive in a workplace that values both your growth and well-being!

