duties:
As a Mobile Engineer at Teko, together we shape our product. In doing so, you'll face a huge amount of challenges that you may not have a chance to face in any other companies out there. They are:

- Write clean code to develop & maintain mobile applications (android/iOS) in digital transformation projects
- Ensure UI/UX of mobile applications
- Research and provide solutions for digital transformation problems
- Develop base, high performance libraries to be used across projects
- Collaborate with other team (web app, backend) to deliver feature on time with high quality

YOUR SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:

- A Bachelor degree in Information Technology or relevant hands-on experience (at least 1 year) as Flutter developer
- Knowledge of native platform (android/iOS) is a plus
- Ability to analyze problem and express ideas clearly in communication and documentation
- A solid Agile/Scrum mindset, comfortable with rapid iteration and continuous improvement; Proficiency in utilizing collaborative tools like Confluence, Jira, etc

Why you'll love working here:

- Negotiable salary according to qualification (13th-month salary + performance bonus);
- 02 months probation with 100% of Gross salary;
- The working environment is open, energetic and professional. More opportunities for career promotion;
- Free Food & Drink: lunch, fresh fruit/cake, coffee&tea;
- Annual health check and attractive Premium healthcare coverage under the company’s own policy;
- Employee Relationship: company trip, team bonding & clubs;
- Leave Paid: 12 days for annual leave & 6 days for sick leave (max 18 days);
- Working time: Monday to Friday (Flexible from 8:30 - 9:00 AM to 5:30 - 6:00 PM).

